  unitranche deal followed from origination through to a covenant test that
  trips the reconciliation flag, plus the fund position and mark it rolls up to.

  Validate with xmllint, passing this file and the schema:
    xmllint (noout) (schema schema.canonical.xsd) example-instance.xml
  i.e. `xmllint` with the usual two long options, spelled out here without
  the leading double hyphens because XML comments cannot contain them.

  That also compiles the schema and checks every xs:keyref, so it is the
  regression test for both files.
-->
